   "id": "2097468600504479954",
   "url": "https://x.com/DrAlexUrology/status/2097468600504479954",
   "conversationId": "2097468600504479954",
   "text": "It is time to hold health plans accountable. \n\nFirst, they refuse in-network contracts or offer contracts that are impossible to make work.  Doctors are forced into hospital employment subsidized by facility fees. \n\nTurns out that insurance companies make more money by underpaying doctors than doctors get paid. Then they bill employee plans for NSA. Then they get a cut of the NSA payment. \n\nThen they refuse to pay but take the money from self funded plans as “arbitrage”.  \n\nEach dollar in costs is stripped by insurance companies during the payment process so that at most 15 cents is actually paid out.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-08T23:34:18.000Z",
   "type": "quote",
   "author": {
