   "conversationId": "2094967920736489551",
   "text": "A third of valid claims are denied for no good reason. \n\nShort of a lawsuit under ERISA that starts at $50,000 in legal fees, patients and especially physicians have no recourse. \n\nThe @USDOL complaints are  a “voluntary compliance” program. This means that health plans can completely ignore a complaint to the US Department of Labor with no repercussions.   Sweet deal!",
