   "conversationId": "2093704431200047111",
   "text": "The last thing you want is for “disinterested” DC bureaucrats to control it. \n\nDC bureaucrats means @AHIPCoverage, the lobbyist that outspends collectively the AMA 100:1. \n\nThe CPT costs are a drop in the bucket when CMS is protecting the racket of charging medical practices >$10 Billion per year for the right to be paid via ACH fees and virtual credit cards. \n\nWhen billions are stolen from physicians by CMS RAC contractors because the rules are stacked against medical practices. \n\n@DrOzCMS should fix real problems first.",
