   "conversationId": "2092762153358905372",
   "text": "These are actually payments for provided care.  The alternative that existed before is that physicians got paid $0.  I have many receipts. Nights and holidays in ER/ OR. Payment denied $0 paid. \n\nMeanwhile, health insurances profit when they deny payments for medically necessary care that was already provided. \n\nElevance Health (formerly known as Anthem) reported a full-year 2025 net profit of $5.66 billion.\n\nUnitedHealth Group's full-year 2025 net profit was $12.1 billion",
   "lang": "en",
